00:08:23.400 --> 00:08:26.410
casting has been the bigger issue

00:08:26.410 --> 00:08:28.680
and way to fix things for people

00:08:28.680 --> 00:08:30.150
than utilities.

00:08:30.150 --> 00:08:31.513
Not reinventing

00:08:31.513 --> 00:08:33.420
what a football team does,

00:08:33.420 --> 00:08:34.890
just getting a better quarterback

00:08:34.890 --> 00:08:36.340
and left tackle.

00:08:36.340 --> 00:08:37.210
- Oh, okay.

00:08:37.210 --> 00:08:38.580
- Not creating some new scheme

00:08:38.580 --> 00:08:40.000
that has never been invented,

00:08:40.000 --> 00:08:41.480
run the ball on every play.

00:08:41.480 --> 00:08:43.330
Flea flickers on every third play.

00:08:43.330 --> 00:08:44.163
Not that.

00:08:44.163 --> 00:08:46.313
It's, replace your right guard.

00:08:47.470 --> 00:08:48.400
- Hmm, I see what you're saying.

00:08:48.400 --> 00:08:50.240
- And so, it's something worth debating,

00:08:50.240 --> 00:08:52.360
'cause what it will do, if nothing else,

00:08:52.360 --> 00:08:54.088
what I'm excited about
when you leave right now,

00:08:54.088 --> 00:08:55.860
I'm hoping that this energy

00:08:55.860 --> 00:08:56.890
will run through your mind,

00:08:56.890 --> 00:08:58.640
so that when you look at something,

00:08:58.640 --> 00:09:00.880
you're like, is this a utility thing,

00:09:00.880 --> 00:09:02.420
or a casting thing?

00:09:02.420 --> 00:09:05.410
- The whole reason I legitimately put

00:09:05.410 --> 00:09:06.420
your shoes on
(audio distorts)

00:09:06.420 --> 00:09:07.781
and did a bunch of flips

00:09:07.781 --> 00:09:09.100
out of the plane

00:09:09.100 --> 00:09:11.109
was because that was exactly the activity

00:09:11.109 --> 00:09:14.244
that resonates very strongly with my

00:09:14.244 --> 00:09:16.830
impetus to start my company,

00:09:16.830 --> 00:09:19.860
was overcoming fear, destroying anxiety,

00:09:19.860 --> 00:09:21.119
taking the right steps,

00:09:21.119 --> 00:09:24.869
which include throwing
myself out of a plane.

00:09:27.257 --> 00:09:29.924
(hip hop music)

